  by: agent  # 5560
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 5560
  clock: 7  # 5560
  nonce: '5560'  # 5560
  message: "DONE: merged in PR #1379 (dev 8723591378; commits 2a35babe9a, a5a2c7a8a9 plus the integration commit b3f53da1ba reconciling the extends/implements descriptions with WI-lahub/WI-vitas). Root cause: TS interface symbols carried no base_classes (the interface_declaration branch never read the extends_type_clause) and js_ts's edge extractor skipped non-class sources; separately the core inheritance linker labelled any interface target `implements` regardless of source. Fix: js_ts extracts interface bases and emits `extends` for every interface-source edge (external import hint kept); the core linker emits `extends` for an interface/trait/protocol source, Kotlin's own emitter corrected the same way; analyzer-edge dedup by (src,dst) pair. Behavioural evidence: a fixture survey emits `Child -extends-> Base` (one edge) and `MyObs -extends-> typescript:rxjs:0-0:Observer` where dev emitted neither; production-path test test_ts_interface_inheritance.py::TestInterfaceInheritancePipeline (run_behavior_map). Not measured on a corpus. NOT asserted: C# interface bases (WI-ruzid), Go interface embedding (WI-gutas), relative-import external base (WI-davih). Report: run_09302026/kalug.md"  # 5560
